1. Boundary work:
   Gieryn, Lamont, Molnar

   How it mirrors our case:
   Our case shows forum members and moderation drawing a line around what counts as a legitimate sociology topic, legitimate research-methods concern, legitimate speaker, and legitimate form of evidence. The key move is not only "this is wrong," but "this is not our topic," "this is slop," and "this does not belong in this room."

