6. Boundary objects:
   Star and Griesemer

   How it mirrors our case:
   Our GitHub evidence files and transcript records were trying to function as boundary objects between software testing, chatbot workflow, and social-science method. The failure mode is that the forum did not treat the object as a bridge. It treated the object as coming from the wrong domain.

