9. Co-writing, authenticity, and AI-mediated voice:
   Hwang, Liao, Blodgett, Olteanu, Trischler

   How it mirrors our case:
   Our methods claim depends on process. A final post alone does not show how human intention, model output, edits, drift, repair, and reuse interacted. Co-writing research gives us a direct way to frame AI-assisted writing as workflow rather than fraud/no-fraud binary.

